    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Email enquiries only, please. No phone calls.\r\n\r\nNEW TO LET – First Letting\r\n\r\n2 Bedroom, 2 Bathroom Townhouse\r\nHenry Wiltshire Estate Agents are delighted to present the first letting of No. 52 Newtown Avenue, Kill. Finished to an exceptional standard throughout, this beautifully presented townhouse offers bright, contemporary accommodation in one of Kill's most sought-after developments.\r\n\r\nThe property comprises two spacious double bedrooms, two modern bathrooms, a bright and welcoming living room, a contemporary fitted kitchen with integrated appliances, a separate utility room, generous storage, private off-street parking, and a low-maintenance rear garden. The home is A-rated, providing excellent energy efficiency and year-round comfort.\r\n\r\nIdeally located in the heart of Kill, the property offers easy access to the M7 motorway, making commuting to Naas, Newbridge, and Dublin straightforward. A range of local shops, cafés, schools, and everyday amenities are all within easy reach.\r\n\r\nThis is an excellent opportunity to rent a high-quality home presented in immaculate condition in a prime location.\r\n\r\nAvailable immediately."
      },
